  "html": "\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">\n</p><div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#333333\"><a name=\"top\"></a></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/map/images/left_menu/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><select data-goto=\"self\" size=\"1\">\n<option selected=\"\" title=\"원래 표기: Catalog*********\">Catalog</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/britian/\">브리튼</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/magincia/\">마젠시아</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/minoc/\">미녹</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/moonglow/\">문글로우</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/skara/\">스카라브레이스</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/trinsic/\">트린식</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/buccanee/\">부케니아덴</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/cove/\">코브</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/jhelom/\">젤롬</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/nujelm/\">뉴젤롬</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/ocello/\">오클로</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/serpent/\">셔펜드홀드</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/vesper/\">베스퍼</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/yew/\">유</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/delucia/\">델루시아</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/papua/\">파푸아</option>\n<option>----------------</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/world/\">월드맵</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/ilshenar/\">일쉐나전체지도</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/t2a/\">잃어버린대륙</option>\n<option value=\"/site/map/malas/\">말라스</option>\n<option value=\"/site/skill_knowhow/uo_knowhow_tmap/\">보물지도</option>\n</select><img border=\"0\" height=\"17\" src=\"/img/posts/site/map/images/left_menu/map_up.gif\" width=\"200\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/map/images/left_menu/memo_m.gif\" height=\"356\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/map/images/left_menu/alpha/alpha_background.gif\" height=\"30\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/posts/site/map/images/left_menu/alpha/u.gif\" width=\"30\">O.MAPS</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/map/images/left_menu/alpha/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"378\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><img border=\"1\" height=\"560\" src=\"/img/posts/site/map/lostland.gif\" usemap=\"#ImageMap1\" width=\"560\"></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">※ \n                            </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">각각의 \n                            던전이름을 누르시면 해당 던전의 상세정보로 보실 \n                            수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">※ \n                            바다위에 있는 뱀기둥의 워프지점 2곳은</span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\n</span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">\"sueacron\"외치시면 \n                            브리티니아대륙으로 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;배와함께 \n                            워프됩니다. 브리타니아대륙에서-잃어버린대륙으로는 \n                            \"doracron\"입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">※ \n                            파푸아(Papua)마을 시약상점의 판타그램(빨간마법원)에서 \n                            \"Recsu\"를 외치시면 브리타니아대륙의 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;문글로우(Moonglow)시약상점으로 \n                            워프하게 됩니다. </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;반대로 \n                            브리타니아에서 파푸아로 가실려면 \"Recdu\"를 \n                            외치시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">※ \n                            </span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">지도의 특성상 큰지도를 받으실려면 \n                위에 여기를<b> </b></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20071128203617/http://www.forg.co.kr/map/uo.zip\" target=\"_blank\"><b><font color=\"#3333FF\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Click!!</font></b></a></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:5; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font><a href=\"#top\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/map/top.gif\" width=\"20\"></a></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/map/images/left_menu/memo_b.gif\" height=\"20\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/map/images/left_menu/b_logo.gif\" width=\"100\"></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<map name=\"ImageMap1\">\n<area coords=\"26, 198, 142, 216\" href=\"/site/dungeon/City_of_dead/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"2, 236, 92, 261\" href=\"/site/dungeon/Trinsic_Passage/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"85, 126, 174, 155\" href=\"/site/dungeon/Terathan_Keep/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"399, 22, 531, 43\" href=\"/site/dungeon/Ice_Dungeon/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"462, 59, 541, 84\" href=\"/site/dungeon/Ophidian_Lair/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"387, 384, 526, 403\" href=\"/site/dungeon/Fire_Dungeon/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"339, 430, 492, 450\" href=\"/site/dungeon/Britain_Passage/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"148, 83, 230, 113\" href=\"/site/dungeon/Cyclops_Valley/\" shape=\"rect\">\n<area coords=\"20, 477, 121, 504\" href=\"/site/dungeon/Khaldun/\" shape=\"rect\">\n</map>",
